1
00:00:00,857 --> 00:00:06,429
约 860 亿个神经元 · 逾百万亿个突触
~86 billion neurons · 100+ trillion synapses

2
00:00:06,857 --> 00:00:13,286
一场穿越大脑的旅程
A journey through the brain

3
00:00:06,857 --> 00:00:13,286
人类大脑
THE HUMAN BRAIN

4
00:00:13,714 --> 00:00:17,143
计划、决策与自主运动的指挥部
Command center for planning, decisions & voluntary movement

5
00:00:17,143 --> 00:00:20,571
约占大脑皮层的三分之一
About one-third of the cerebral cortex

6
00:00:20,571 --> 00:00:24,000
整合触觉、痛觉与身体位置感
Integrates touch, pain & body position

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,429
构建空间地图，引导注意与动作
Builds spatial maps that guide attention & action

8
00:00:27,429 --> 00:00:30,857
听觉与语言理解（韦尼克区）
Hearing & language comprehension (Wernicke's area)

9
00:00:30,857 --> 00:00:34,286
识别面孔与物体，参与记忆
Recognizes faces & objects, supports memory

10
00:00:34,286 --> 00:00:37,714
视觉皮层：解析形状、颜色与运动
Visual cortex: decodes shape, color & motion

11
00:00:37,714 --> 00:00:41,143
视觉由此分为“是什么”与“在哪里”两条通路
Vision splits into 'what' & 'where' streams

12
00:00:41,143 --> 00:00:44,571
藏于外侧沟深处的“第五脑叶”
The hidden 'fifth lobe' deep in the lateral sulcus

13
00:00:44,571 --> 00:00:48,000
感知心跳与饥饿等内感受，塑造主观感受
Senses heartbeat & hunger — interoception that shapes feelings

14
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,429
约 2 亿根神经纤维
~200 million nerve fibers

15
00:00:51,429 --> 00:00:54,857
连接左右大脑半球的信息高速公路
The information highway between the two hemispheres

16
00:00:54,857 --> 00:00:58,286
感觉信息的中继枢纽（嗅觉除外）
Relay hub for the senses (except smell)

17
00:00:58,286 --> 00:01:01,714
调控觉醒、注意与意识状态
Gates arousal, attention & consciousness

18
00:01:01,714 --> 00:01:05,143
仅约 4 克，掌控体温、饥渴与睡眠
Only ~4 g, yet governs temperature, hunger, thirst & sleep

19
00:01:05,143 --> 00:01:08,571
经垂体指挥全身内分泌系统
Commands the endocrine system via the pituitary

20
00:01:08,571 --> 00:01:12,000
动作选择：“启动”还是“刹车”
Action selection: 'go' or 'stop'

21
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,429
习惯与奖赏学习；帕金森病的核心受累环路
Habits & reward learning; the circuit hit by Parkinson's disease

22
00:01:15,429 --> 00:01:18,857
把经历转化为长期记忆
Turns experiences into lasting memories

23
00:01:18,857 --> 00:01:22,286
位置细胞绘制大脑的“内置 GPS”
Place cells build the brain's inner GPS

24
00:01:22,286 --> 00:01:25,714
威胁探测器：快速评估情绪意义
Threat detector: rapidly tags emotional significance

25
00:01:25,714 --> 00:01:29,143
驱动恐惧学习，强化情绪记忆
Drives fear learning & strengthens emotional memories

26
00:01:29,143 --> 00:01:32,571
协调运动、平衡与动作学习
Coordinates movement, balance & motor learning

27
00:01:32,571 --> 00:01:36,000
约占脑重 10%，却拥有约 80% 的神经元
~10% of brain mass, yet ~80% of its neurons

28
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,429
呼吸、心跳、血压——生命中枢
Breathing, heartbeat, blood pressure — the core of life

29
00:01:39,429 --> 00:01:42,857
12 对脑神经中有 10 对由此发出
Origin of 10 of the 12 pairs of cranial nerves

30
00:01:42,857 --> 00:01:46,286
而在所有脑区之中……
And among all of them…

31
00:01:46,286 --> 00:01:49,714
有一处，承载着人类最高阶的智慧
one region holds our highest cognition

32
00:01:51,429 --> 00:01:55,929
前额叶皮层
PREFRONTAL CORTEX

33
00:01:56,571 --> 00:02:00,000
大脑的“首席执行官”：执行控制中枢
The brain's CEO: the hub of executive control

34
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,429
发育成熟最晚的脑区之一，持续至成年早期
One of the last regions to mature — into early adulthood

35
00:02:03,429 --> 00:02:06,857
工作记忆：在脑中保持并操作信息
Working memory: holding & manipulating information

36
00:02:06,857 --> 00:02:10,286
制定计划、切换策略、抽象推理
Planning, strategy switching & abstract reasoning

37
00:02:10,286 --> 00:02:13,714
反应抑制：行为的“刹车”（以右侧为主）
Response inhibition: the brain's brake (right-lateralized)

38
00:02:13,714 --> 00:02:17,143
左侧含布洛卡区：语言产出与语义提取
Left side hosts Broca's area: speech & semantic retrieval

39
00:02:17,143 --> 00:02:20,571
计算奖赏价值：“这值得吗？”
Computes reward value: 'Is it worth it?'

40
00:02:20,571 --> 00:02:24,000
结果改变时迅速更新预期
Rapidly updates expectations when outcomes change

41
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:27,429
整合情绪与价值，做出个人与社会决策
Integrates emotion & value for personal and social decisions

42
00:02:27,429 --> 00:02:30,857
盖奇（1848）：损伤后人格骤变
Phineas Gage (1848): personality transformed after injury

43
00:02:30,857 --> 00:02:34,286
冲突监测与错误觉察：“出错了！”
Conflict monitoring & error detection: 'Something's wrong!'

44
00:02:34,286 --> 00:02:37,714
权衡努力与回报，驱动动机
Weighs effort against reward to drive motivation

45
00:02:37,714 --> 00:02:41,143
心理理论：推测他人的想法与意图
Theory of mind: inferring others' thoughts & intentions

46
00:02:41,143 --> 00:02:44,571
自我反思：思考“我是谁”
Self-reflection: thinking about who I am

47
00:02:44,571 --> 00:02:48,000
大脑最前端：同时驾驭多个目标
The frontmost cortex: juggling multiple goals at once

48
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:51,429
元认知：反思自己的思考
Metacognition: thinking about your own thinking

49
00:02:51,429 --> 00:02:54,857
前额叶从不孤军奋战
The prefrontal cortex never works alone

50
00:02:54,857 --> 00:02:58,286
它通过网络调度整个大脑
It orchestrates the whole brain through networks

51
00:02:58,286 --> 00:03:04,929
认识大脑，就是认识你自己
To know the brain is to know yourself

